sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User (Pentester)
  participant FE as Frontend (SPA)
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant AG as Agent Loop
  participant LLM as LLM Provider
  participant TL as Scanner Tools
  participant T as Target

  U->>FE: Pilih target, scan profile, provider/model, (auth), max_steps
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/dynamic/scan {target, profile, model, ...}
  API->>API: Validasi provider/model, cek scan berjalan (1 per user)
  alt Tidak valid / sudah ada scan berjalan
    API-->>FE: 4xx / 409
    FE-->>U: Tampilkan error
  else Valid
    API->>DB: Simpan scan status "running", buat scan_id
    API-->>FE: 202 Accepted {scan_id}
    Note over API,AG: Proses berjalan asinkron (background)

    par Proses background (Sistem)
      API->>AG: Mulai agent loop
      AG->>TL: Recon prelude (httpx_probe, katana_crawl)
      TL->>T: Probe & crawl
      T-->>TL: Respons
      TL-->>AG: Hasil recon
      loop Tiap step (sampai final / max_steps / cancel)
        AG->>LLM: Kirim transcript
        LLM-->>AG: Aksi (thought / tool / final)
        alt Aksi = tool
          AG->>AG: Validasi guard (profile, scope/SSRF, payload, policy)
          alt Lolos guard
            AG->>TL: Eksekusi tool
            TL->>T: Uji keamanan terkontrol
            T-->>TL: Respons
            TL-->>AG: Observasi + signals (+1 step)
          else Ditolak guard
            AG->>AG: Catat REJECTED ke transcript
          end
        end
      end
      AG->>DB: Simpan status terminal (completed/failed/cancelled)
      opt Status completed
        AG->>DB: Simpan laporan otomatis
      end
    and Alur User (polling)
      loop Sampai status bukan "running"
        FE->>API: GET /api/v1/scans/{scan_id}
        API->>DB: Ambil status & progress
        DB-->>API: Status
        API-->>FE: Status / progress
      end
      opt User membatalkan scan
        U->>FE: Klik "Cancel"
        FE->>API: POST /api/v1/scans/{scan_id}/cancel
        API->>DB: Tandai permintaan batal
        Note over AG: Loop berhenti di antara langkah
      end
    end

    FE-->>U: Tampilkan hasil scan + laporan
  end
